{"version":1,"content":"<p>微博話題「iPhone Duo破發」引發網友熱議。<strong>有數碼城老闆向記者透露，今年不少囤貨的黃牛損失慘重，部分人虧損超過20萬元。由於市場行情持續下跌，不少黃牛陷入「一邊收貨、一邊跌價」的困境。總而言之，首批高價囤貨的商家虧損嚴重。</strong></p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587624.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T09:23:53.219828+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T09:03:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T09:17:13.166516+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T09:17:13.166516+00:00","content_hash":"3e13f636899c3d143d91ce555dfb5a0852d04a7387946e54ed49c27a1a2e2709","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}